GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "I couldn’t win at the slots, and I\n"
	.string "blew it on card flipping...\p"
	.string "I got so furious, I tossed out my\n"
	.string "COIN CASE in the UNDERGROUND.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Beauty::
	.string "I won’t quit until I win!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "I taught BLIZZARD to my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It was hard to get enough coins for\n"
	.string "it, but it was worth it.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Rocker::
	.string "I just love this new slot machine.\p"
	.string "It’s more of a challenge than the\n"
	.string "ones in CELADON.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Man::
	.string "Life is a gamble. I’m going to flip\n"
	.string "cards till I drop!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Woman3::
	.string "Card flip...\p"
	.string "I prefer it over the slots because\n"
	.string "it’s easier to figure the odds.\l"
	.string "But the payout is much lower.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_WorkerM_1::
	.string "Welcome to the GAME CORNER.\p"
	.string "Do you need game coins?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_WorkerM_2::
	.string "No?\n"
	.string "Please come play sometime!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_WorkerM_3::
	.string "Oh, you don’t have a COIN CASE for\n"
	.string "your coins.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_WorkerM_4::
	.string "Whoops!\n"
	.string "Your COIN CASE is full.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_WorkerM_5::
	.string "You can’t afford the COINS.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_WorkerM_6::
	.string "Thank you.\n"
	.string "Here are your COINS!$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_1::
	.string "We exchange your COINS for prizes.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_2::
	.string "So, you want ABRA?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_3::
	.string "So, you want EKANS?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_4::
	.string "So, you want DRATINI?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_7::
	.string "I’m sorry, you don’t have enough\n"
	.string "coins...$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_8::
	.string "{PLAYER} received ABRA.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_9::
	.string "{PLAYER} received EKANS.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist_10::
	.string "{PLAYER} received DRATINI.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist2_1::
	.string "Okay, a TM of THUNDER\n"
	.string "is what you want?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist2_2::
	.string "Okay, a TM of BLIZZARD\n"
	.string "is what you want?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_CableClubReceptionist2_3::
	.string "Okay, a TM of FIRE BLAST\n"
	.string "is what you want?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "A slot machine!\n"
	.string "Want to play?$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "You have no coins.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Sign10::
	.string "OUT OF ORDER\n"
	.string "This is broken.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Sign18::
	.string "OUT TO LUNCH\n"
	.string "This is reserved.$"

GoldenrodCity_Interior1_Text_Sign24::
	.string "Someone’s keys!\n"
	.string "They’ll be back.$"
